---
/* ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
   声音控制按钮 · 方案设计 MOCK 评测台 (/mock/sound/)
   · 评测全站常驻声音按钮的 4 种精简与精妙重构方案
   · 支持醒/梦两态切换、阅读段落干扰度测试、阅读电平退让测试
   · 支持直接投射到屏幕真实左下角体验常驻质感
   ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
import '../../styles/tokens.css';
import '../../styles/global.css';
import '@fontsource/ibm-plex-mono/400.css';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>声音按钮设计 Mock · 方案评测</title>
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/fonts/noto-serif-sc/font.css" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <!-- 顶部工作台控制条 -->
    <header class="mock-bar">
      <div class="mock-bar-inner">
        <div class="mock-brand">
          <span class="mock-tag mono">PROTOTYPE</span>
          <h1 class="mock-title">常驻声音控制按钮 · 四套设计方案</h1>
        </div>

        <div class="mock-controls">
          <div class="mock-group">
            <span class="mock-group-label mono">STATE</span>
            <button type="button" class="mock-btn is-active" data-face-toggle="wake">醒面 WAKE</button>
            <button type="button" class="mock-btn" data-face-toggle="dream">梦面 DREAM</button>
          </div>

          <div class="mock-group">
            <span class="mock-group-label mono">SCENARIO</span>
            <button type="button" class="mock-btn" data-mode-toggle="reading">模拟阅读长文</button>
            <button type="button" class="mock-btn" data-mode-toggle="trim">阅读页退让 (−5dB)</button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main class="mock-main">
      <!-- 引导说明 -->
      <section class="mock-intro">
        <p class="mock-lead">
          本站核心审美为《醒梦》：<b>神秘、朦胧、安静、磨砂玻璃、半透明树脂、大面积留白</b>。
          左下角声音按钮常驻于全站每一页，其核心是<b>「在视野余光中如晨雾般退后，在指尖触碰时如水波般精妙」</b>。
          以下分别提供 Baseline（现行版）与四套重构方案，支持实时点击切换、悬浮展开与投射到真实左下角。
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- 方案栅格 -->
      <section class="mock-grid">
        <!-- ── 方案 Baseline ────────────────────────────────────── -->
        <article class="scheme-card" data-scheme="baseline">
          <div class="sc-head">
            <span class="sc-no mono">BASELINE</span>
            <h2 class="sc-title">现行胶囊卡片（对比基线）</h2>
          </div>
          <p class="sc-desc">
            约 140×32px。带 ⌜ ⌟ 角标、光核、5 字长文字与 AUDIBLE/SILENT 标签。文字信息量较大，常驻时在余光中占用较多认知带宽。
          </p>

          <div class="sc-stage-box">
            <div class="sc-stage">
              <!-- 真实交互组件 -->
              <button class="snd-demo snd-baseline" type="button" data-interactive-btn>
                <span class="snd-reticle snd-rt-tl mono" aria-hidden="true">⌜</span>
                <span class="snd-reticle snd-rt-br mono" aria-hidden="true">⌟</span>
                <span class="snd-core" aria-hidden="true"><i></i></span>
                <span class="snd-label snd-lbl-on">关闭环境声</span>
                <span class="snd-label snd-lbl-off">开启环境声</span>
                <span class="snd-tag mono">AUDIBLE</span>
              </button>
            </div>
            <div class="sc-specs mono">
              <span>SIZE: 142×32px</span>
              <span>TYPE: 完整功能卡片</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="sc-foot">
            <button type="button" class="sc-dock-btn" data-dock="baseline">投射到真实左下角 ↘</button>
          </div>
        </article>

        <!-- ── 方案 A ─────────────────────────────────────────── -->
        <article class="scheme-card is-recommended" data-scheme="a">
          <div class="sc-head">
            <div class="sc-head-badge">
              <span class="sc-no mono">OPTION A</span>
              <span class="sc-pill mono">RECOMMENDED</span>
            </div>
            <h2 class="sc-title">凝核微隙（The Micro-Slit）</h2>
          </div>
          <p class="sc-desc">
            <b>默认收拢，悬停舒展</b>。平时仅为 30×30px 的半透明磨砂树脂微体，呼吸琥珀微核；光标掠过时如水滴张力般优雅展开文字与状态。视线余光零压迫，触碰时清晰笃定。
          </p>

          <div class="sc-stage-box">
            <div class="sc-stage">
              <!-- 交互按钮 -->
              <button class="snd-demo snd-slit" type="button" data-interactive-btn title="环境声开关">
                <span class="slit-core" aria-hidden="true"><i></i></span>
                <span class="slit-expand">
                  <span class="slit-text slit-text-wake-on">环境声</span>
                  <span class="slit-text slit-text-wake-off">静默中</span>
                  <span class="slit-text slit-text-dream-on">回响</span>
                  <span class="slit-text slit-text-dream-off">沉落</span>
                  <span class="slit-badge mono">BGM</span>
                </span>
              </button>
            </div>
            <div class="sc-specs mono">
              <span>DEFAULT: 30×30px</span>
              <span>EXPANDED: 104×30px</span>
              <span>RADIUS: 6px</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="sc-foot">
            <button type="button" class="sc-dock-btn" data-dock="a">投射到真实左下角 ↘</button>
          </div>
        </article>

        <!-- ── 方案 B ─────────────────────────────────────────── -->
        <article class="scheme-card" data-scheme="b">
          <div class="sc-head">
            <span class="sc-no mono">OPTION B</span>
            <h2 class="sc-title">音律微弦（The Resonant Filament）</h2>
          </div>
          <p class="sc-desc">
            <b>纯粹感官，声学物化</b>。彻底去除外壳边框与卡片感，仅以三根极细光学发丝构成。发声时各按不同质数周期（2.4s/3.1s/1.9s）自然起伏摆动，梦面伴随微弱柔焦与泛音拖尾。
          </p>

          <div class="sc-stage-box">
            <div class="sc-stage">
              <!-- 交互按钮 -->
              <button class="snd-demo snd-filament" type="button" data-interactive-btn title="环境声音律微弦">
                <span class="fl-strings" aria-hidden="true">
                  <i class="fl-str fl-s1"></i>
                  <i class="fl-str fl-s2"></i>
                  <i class="fl-str fl-s3"></i>
                </span>
                <span class="fl-tip mono">AUDIBLE</span>
              </button>
            </div>
            <div class="sc-specs mono">
              <span>SIZE: 28×28px (HOTZONE)</span>
              <span>FILAMENTS: 3 × 1.25px</span>
              <span>STYLE: 无边框声学标本</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="sc-foot">
            <button type="button" class="sc-dock-btn" data-dock="b">投射到真实左下角 ↘</button>
          </div>
        </article>

        <!-- ── 方案 C ─────────────────────────────────────────── -->
        <article class="scheme-card" data-scheme="c">
          <div class="sc-head">
            <span class="sc-no mono">OPTION C</span>
            <h2 class="sc-title">光学微镜（The Optical Specimen）</h2>
          </div>
          <p class="sc-desc">
            <b>家族化硬质精密，尺寸浓缩至 1/4</b>。继承 Rail 与 RealityGuide 同款 ⌜ ⌟ 光学微刻角标与磨砂微章，浓缩为 28×28px 方印。发声时中心琥珀凝聚，向外泛出极细同心水波涟漪。
          </p>

          <div class="sc-stage-box">
            <div class="sc-stage">
              <!-- 交互按钮 -->
              <button class="snd-demo snd-optic" type="button" data-interactive-btn title="光学声音微镜">
                <span class="op-reticle op-rt-tl mono" aria-hidden="true">⌜</span>
                <span class="op-reticle op-rt-br mono" aria-hidden="true">⌟</span>
                <span class="op-lens" aria-hidden="true">
                  <i class="op-dot"></i>
                  <i class="op-ripple"></i>
                </span>
              </button>
            </div>
            <div class="sc-specs mono">
              <span>SIZE: 28×28px</span>
              <span>RETICLE: ⌜ ⌟ 4px</span>
              <span>RIPPLE: 3.8s 扩散同心微圈</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="sc-foot">
            <button type="button" class="sc-dock-btn" data-dock="c">投射到真实左下角 ↘</button>
          </div>
        </article>

        <!-- ── 方案 D ─────────────────────────────────────────── -->
        <article class="scheme-card" data-scheme="d">
          <div class="sc-head">
            <span class="sc-no mono">OPTION D</span>
            <h2 class="sc-title">声之花蕊（The Acoustic Lily）</h2>
          </div>
          <p class="sc-desc">
            <b>呼应核心母题，去工业化诗意</b>。采用百合简约花型的抽象微线轮廓。静止时如封存标本；发声时花蕊点燃微温琥珀星火，花瓣细线流淌微光，如随呼吸绽放。
          </p>

          <div class="sc-stage-box">
            <div class="sc-stage">
              <!-- 交互按钮 -->
              <button class="snd-demo snd-lily" type="button" data-interactive-btn title="声之花蕊">
                <span class="ly-wrap" aria-hidden="true">
                  <svg class="ly-svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none">
                    <!-- 左花瓣轮廓 -->
                    <path class="ly-petal ly-petal-l" d="M12 21 C8 17 4 13 4 8 C4 4.5 7.5 3 10 6 C11.5 7.8 12 11 12 11" />
                    <!-- 右花瓣轮廓 -->
                    <path class="ly-petal ly-petal-r" d="M12 21 C16 17 20 13 20 8 C20 4.5 16.5 3 14 6 C12.5 7.8 12 11 12 11" />
                    <!-- 花蕊微线 -->
                    <path class="ly-stem" d="M12 21 L12 11" />
                  </svg>
                  <i class="ly-core"></i>
                </span>
              </button>
            </div>
            <div class="sc-specs mono">
              <span>SIZE: 28×28px</span>
              <span>MOTIF: 百合抽象单线</span>
              <span>MOTION: 微光描边流转 + 花蕊星火</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="sc-foot">
            <button type="button" class="sc-dock-btn" data-dock="d">投射到真实左下角 ↘</button>
          </div>
        </article>
      </section>

      <!-- 模拟长文阅读段落（测试余光干扰度） -->
      <section class="mock-reading" id="reading-zone">
        <div class="mock-reading-inner">
          <span class="mr-eyebrow mono">READING PROJECTION · 余光感知对比段</span>
          <h3 class="mr-title">在即将醒来的那一瞬，世界究竟是在成形，还是正在融化？</h3>
          <p class="mr-p">
            世界应当始终保留一种感觉：它随时可能消失，又随时可能重新被记起。
            两态各一套循环音频并行同相位流动，长按入梦时，声音跟着微斜的发丝线一起交叉换面，而不是生硬地切断与跳跃。
            此时请将视线集中在文字中央，用眼角的余光去体会左下角常驻按钮的存在感——一个优秀的常驻设计，应当静穆如晨光中的水汽，唯有在需要触碰时，才给出最纯善的微光。
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>

    <!-- 真实左下角投射区（全局常驻模拟机位） -->
    <aside class="screen-dock-anchor" id="dock-anchor" aria-label="左下角常驻位置">
      <div class="dock-label mono">CURRENT DOCKED</div>
      <div class="dock-slot" id="dock-slot">
        <!-- 动态塞入被选中的方案 -->
      </div>
    </aside>

    <script>
      // 1. 双态与情境控制
      const html = document.documentElement;
      const faceBtns = document.querySelectorAll('[data-face-toggle]');
      faceBtns.forEach(btn => {
        btn.addEventListener('click', () => {
          faceBtns.forEach(b => b.classList.remove('is-active'));
          btn.classList.add('is-active');
          const face = btn.getAttribute('data-face-toggle');
          if (face === 'dream') {
            html.dataset.face = 'dream';
            html.style.setProperty('--reality-mix', '0');
          } else {
            html.dataset.face = 'wake';
            html.style.setProperty('--reality-mix', '1');
          }
        });
      });

      // 模拟阅读与衰减
      const readingBtn = document.querySelector('[data-mode-toggle="reading"]');
      readingBtn?.addEventListener('click', () => {
        readingBtn.classList.toggle('is-active');
        document.body.classList.toggle('show-reading-focus');
        if (document.body.classList.contains('show-reading-focus')) {
          document.getElementById('reading-zone')?.scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth' });
        }
      });

      const trimBtn = document.querySelector('[data-mode-toggle="trim"]');
      trimBtn?.addEventListener('click', () => {
        trimBtn.classList.toggle('is-active');
        document.body.classList.toggle('is-trimmed');
      });

      // 2. 按钮点击切换开关态（ON / OFF）
      const btns = document.querySelectorAll('[data-interactive-btn]');
      btns.forEach(btn => {
        btn.addEventListener('click', (e) => {
          e.stopPropagation();
          btn.classList.toggle('is-on');
          // 如果当前投射槽内有同步的克隆体，同步状态
          const scheme = btn.closest('[data-scheme]')?.getAttribute('data-scheme');
          if (scheme) {
            syncDockState(scheme, btn.classList.contains('is-on'));
          }
        });
        // 默认初始化为开启态，便于直接看效果
        btn.classList.add('is-on');
      });

      // 3. 投射到真实左下角
      const dockSlot = document.getElementById('dock-slot');
      const dockBtns = document.querySelectorAll('[data-dock]');

      function setDocked(schemeId: string) {
        if (!dockSlot) return;
        dockBtns.forEach(b => b.classList.remove('is-docked'));
        const activeBtn = document.querySelector(`[data-dock="${schemeId}"]`);
        activeBtn?.classList.add('is-docked');

        const card = document.querySelector(`[data-scheme="${schemeId}"]`);
        const targetBtn = card?.querySelector('[data-interactive-btn]') as HTMLElement;
        if (!targetBtn) return;

        dockSlot.innerHTML = '';
        const clone = targetBtn.cloneNode(true) as HTMLElement;
        clone.id = 'docked-interactive-btn';
        clone.addEventListener('click', () => {
          clone.classList.toggle('is-on');
          // 反向同步卡片中的原版
          if (clone.classList.contains('is-on')) {
            targetBtn.classList.add('is-on');
          } else {
            targetBtn.classList.remove('is-on');
          }
        });
        dockSlot.appendChild(clone);
      }

      function syncDockState(schemeId: string, isOn: boolean) {
        const activeDockBtn = document.querySelector('.sc-dock-btn.is-docked');
        if (activeDockBtn?.getAttribute('data-dock') === schemeId) {
          const dockedBtn = document.getElementById('docked-interactive-btn');
          if (dockedBtn) {
            if (isOn) dockedBtn.classList.add('is-on');
            else dockedBtn.classList.remove('is-on');
          }
        }
      }

      dockBtns.forEach(b => {
        b.addEventListener('click', () => {
          const scheme = b.getAttribute('data-dock');
          if (scheme) setDocked(scheme);
        });
      });

      // 默认将方案 A 投射到左下角
      setDocked('a');
    </script>
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  /* ── 页面基础 ─────────────────────────────────────────── */
  :root {
    --dock-left: 24px;
    --dock-bottom: 22px;
  }

  html[data-face="dream"] {
    --bg: #15181e;
    --bg-sunken: #0e1115;
    --fg: #e2e7ec;
    --fg-soft: #9aa5b2;
    --fg-faint: #606b78;
    --line: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
  }

  body {
    min-height: 100vh;
    padding-bottom: 120px;
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--fg);
    transition: background 0.4s ease, color 0.4s ease;
  }

  /* 阅读页衰减 -5dB 模拟：让常驻构件更退后一步 */
  body.is-trimmed .snd-demo,
  body.is-trimmed #dock-slot .snd-demo {
    opacity: 0.42 !important;
  }
  body.is-trimmed .snd-demo:hover,
  body.is-trimmed #dock-slot .snd-demo:hover {
    opacity: 1 !important;
  }

  /* ── 顶部控制条 ───────────────────────────────────────── */
  .mock-bar {
    position: sticky;
    top: 0;
    z-index: 50;
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--bg) 82%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08));
    backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    padding: 0.8rem 2rem;
  }
  .mock-bar-inner {
    max-width: 1280px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 1rem;
  }
  .mock-brand {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.8rem;
  }
  .mock-tag {
    font-size: 0.62rem;
    padding: 2px 6px;
    border-radius: 3px;
    border: 1px solid var(--amber);
    color: var(--amber);
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  }
  .mock-title {
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    margin: 0;
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
  }
  .mock-controls {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .mock-group {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.35rem;
  }
  .mock-group-label {
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    color: var(--fg-faint);
    margin-right: 0.3rem;
  }
  .mock-btn {
    font: inherit;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    padding: 0.3rem 0.65rem;
    border-radius: 4px;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--fg-soft);
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
  }
  .mock-btn:hover {
    color: var(--fg);
    border-color: var(--fg-soft);
  }
  .mock-btn.is-active {
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--amber) 15%, transparent);
    border-color: var(--amber);
    color: var(--amber);
  }

  /* ── 页面主体 ─────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .mock-main {
    max-width: 1400px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 2rem 2rem 5rem;
  }
  .mock-intro {
    max-width: 52em;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }
  .mock-lead {
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    line-height: 1.85;
    color: var(--fg-soft);
  }
  .mock-lead b {
    color: var(--fg);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  /* ── 方案栅格（5 列并排横向对比） ─────────────────────── */
  .mock-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr);
    gap: 1.1rem;
    margin-bottom: 3.5rem;
  }
  @media (max-width: 1240px) {
    .mock-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));
    }
  }
  .scheme-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    padding: 1.2rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--bg) 92%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05));
    box-shadow: 0 4px 20px -6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
    transition: border-color 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease, transform 0.25s ease;
  }
  .scheme-card:hover {
    border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--fg-soft) 40%, var(--line));
    box-shadow: 0 8px 30px -8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
  }
  .scheme-card.is-recommended {
    border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--amber) 50%, var(--line));
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--bg) 88%, rgba(217, 160, 91, 0.04));
  }
  .sc-head {
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  .sc-head-badge {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.2rem;
  }
  .sc-no {
    font-size: 0.62rem;
    color: var(--fg-faint);
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  }
  .sc-pill {
    font-size: 0.52rem;
    padding: 1px 4px;
    border-radius: 3px;
    background: var(--amber);
    color: #111;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }
  .sc-title {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin: 0.15rem 0 0;
    line-height: 1.35;
  }
  .sc-desc {
    font-size: 0.76rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--fg-soft);
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    min-height: 5.6em;
  }
  .sc-desc b {
    color: var(--fg);
  }

  /* 舞台容器 */
  .sc-stage-box {
